OL,3,GNEWSAMP 'can't imagine hell Keaton
OL,4,ASlater's parents face'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Warwickshire MP has said he "cannot
OL,7,Fimage the hell" endured by the parents
OL,8,Fof 12-year-old Keaton Slater, who was
OL,9,Fkilled in a hit-and-run in Coventry.
OL,11,FDolars Aleksanders struck the schoolboy
OL,12,Fwith a black BMW 330 on Radford Road on
OL,13,F14 June 2024. He fled to his native
OL,14,FLatvia and evaded police for two years
OL,15,Fbefore being extradited to the UK.
OL,17,FAleksanders is due to be sentenced for
OL,18,Fcausing death by dangerous driving on
OL,19,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
